        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHtVHJoAQb74yolLGk1cKvLJ5FQjpwP92K1xLdjIc-2DXo6Cw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "My mother moved into Lilo in mid-August 2018 and could not be happier! The staff have been nothing less than attentive, comforting and welcoming. The amenities (bowling alley, pool, billiards, library, theater, etc.)  are world-class and activities are constant. The restaurant is at least a 4 star, with a menu that offers a good variety. I cannot say enough good things about Lilo!",
