        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "I would give the place a 5 overall, but I was very disappointed with the Christmas dinner I had with my family. Serving three plates of chicken breast for a dinner for a visitor is really ridiculous! I felt bad suggesting this place for a family dinner and charging almost $17/person. Not to mention the Christmas plate...\nWe are a family of over 24, so it's a shame, but they won't want to go back next year.",
